      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "HIPPOLYTA.\nYou’re out of breath;\nAnd this high-speeded pace is but to say\nThat you shall never, like the maid Flavina,\nLove any that’s called man.",
